~ start
The water has already swallowed the street.
Ollie: ...It's everywhere.
Ollie: The walls, the stairs. Even the sound of it feels like it's coming from inside my head.

if GameState.has_flag("noni_injured")
	Ollie: Noni is still holding her arm. I couldn't even do that right.
elif GameState.has_flag("noni_safe")
	Ollie: Noni is still shaking, but she's safe. At least I did that much.
elif GameState.has_flag("dodong_injured")
	Ollie: Dodong's leg is still bleeding through the cloth. I should have done more.
elif GameState.has_flag("dodong_safe")
	Ollie: Dodong is still clinging to my shirt. His leg is wrapped. He has to be okay.
else
	Ollie: My sibling is right behind me. I have to keep them close.

Papa: Ollie! Over here! Don't just stand there!
Ollie: Papa...
Papa is holding on to the railing with one hand, shouting over the roar of the water.
Ollie: They kept saying it was somebody's fault. Now there's no one left to blame but the water.
Ollie: I can't stay here. If I stay, we all go under.
Ollie: Anything it carries can hurt me. I have to dodge it, keep moving, and reach them.
Ollie: Okay... go.

=> END